<title>USA: NS Group Inc Q2 net, shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>NS Group Inc Q2 net, shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Ky. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended     Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			     Mar 29,   Mar 30,    Mar 29,   Mar 30,</p>
<p>				  1997	1996	 1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales		$111,110  $104,726   $216,277  $194,021</p>
<p> Operating income	  8,854     2,891     14,799     3,498</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	 2,169   (1,508)	2,418   (4,712)</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>  per common shares	  .16     (.11)	  .18     (.34)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	     13,814    13,809     13,812    13,809</p>
<p> EBITDA (1)		 13,568     7,387     24,355    13,542</p>
<p>(1) Represents earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization, and is calculated as income before extraordinary items plus interest expense, taxes, depreciation and amortization.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
